rican Album. Also in 1993 and 1995, Lo Nuestro Billboard gave the band awards in four categories. Selena y ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/quintanilla-perez-selena-selena\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... R&B artist of the 20th century by the Recording Industry Association of America\\nFile:Mariah Carey13 Edwards Dec 1998.jpg|Mariah Carey was declared the Artist of the Decade of the 1990s by Billboard\\n\\nNeo-soul\\n\\nIn the mid-1990s, neo soul, which added 1970s soul influences ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1990s_in_music\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... By the end of the decade, hip hop had spread across the country, especially in Los Angeles and Chicago.\\n\\nSalsa\\n\\nCuban and Puerto Ricans in New York invented salsa in the early 1970s, using multiple sources from Latin America in the pan-Latin melting pot of the city ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_history_of_the_United_States\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d111\",\"snippet\":\" ... Puerto Rico's boy band Menudo had several Latin Hits and English songs including 1985's Hold Me #62 on Billboard Hot 100 and #61 on Billboard Hot R&B. Gloria began crossing over to English music in 1984. Estefan at the time was with the Miami Sound ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Latin_American_music_in_the_United_States\"}],\"query\":\"Billboard 1970s salsa club Los Angeles owner B\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_8894982e5e2d4921927a7d27"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d66\",\"snippet\":\" ... R&B, Soul |\\n\\n| Los Tigres del Norte\\n\\n|\\n\\n1960s - 2020s |\\n\\nLatin, Mexican Tradi